          "question_id": "26宇哥八套卷-卷四-012",
          "question": "$12.$ 设 $y = y(x)$ 满足 $xy' = \\sqrt{1 - x^2}$，$y(1)=0$，则 $\\int_0^1 y(x) dx =$ ______",
          "math_type": "26宇哥八套卷",
          "question_type": "填空题",
          "knowledge_point": "常微分方程",
          "knowledge_points": [
